core-terminal (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add the GTK4/VTE settings panes and profile editor paths.
  * Wire keyboard input, shell exit, title, notification, and saved group
    settings to the terminal runtime.
  * Add the native Wayland acceptance harness.
  * Keep profile names, labeled actions, and editor tabs visible without an
    outer horizontal settings scroller.
  * Add Debian metadata, the core-terminal(1) manual page, and dependency
    license notices.
  * Reject private profile and reference inputs during package checks.

